  {
    "id": "fae23b19-4efc-570a-9a12-896caec7538c",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:necklace-of-fireballs-vii",
    "name": "Necklace of Fireballs VII",
    "level": 17,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["invested", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=449"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This string of beads appears to be a hemp string with lustrous red beads of various sizes hanging from it. When activated, it briefly appears in its true form: a golden chain with golden spheres attached by fine threads."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This necklace has one "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "18d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage, three "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "16d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage and five "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "14d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage beads with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:reflex",
            "dc": 39,
            "basic": true
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save. When all the beads are gone, the necklace becomes a non-magical hemp string."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Interact"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You detach a sphere from the necklace, causing it to glow with orange light. After you activate a sphere, if you or anyone else hurls it (an Interact action with the ranged trait), it detonates as a "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "989ec875-261d-5d4f-a181-fedf889f9d4b"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " where it lands. Your toss can place the center of the fireball anywhere within 70 feet, though at the GM's discretion you might need to make an attack roll if the throw is unusually challenging. If no one hurls the sphere by the start of your next turn, it turns into a non-magical red bead."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.mOY0STwY5hx4UPCN"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 9600
        }
      },
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "usage": {
        "type": "worn"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "c969e4b1-cbdf-5673-9019-19dde7e74997",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:ring-of-maniacal-devices-greater",
    "name": "Ring of Maniacal Devices (Greater)",
    "level": 18,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["invested", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=457"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This ring seems like simple tarnished brass, but it enhances your curiosity about traps and devices of all kinds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You can use an Interact action to pull a set of thieves' tools from the ring. These tools appear in your hand and fold back into the ring if they would leave your possession."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "They grant you a +3 item bonus to Thievery checks to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b2ba8e49-aecf-574a-882d-bef04a43b74f"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b5e569b6-685e-5957-96ef-b148bd98fab6"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and the ring's insights grant you the same bonus to Crafting checks to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "cffa6a55-a0d3-5be2-8169-ba9cf4745e57"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "0c62b450-d8c6-5051-b961-b7ce1aeb349a"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " snares and traps."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 10 minutes (Interact)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You create a 8th-rank "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "6e9049d7-9366-5a37-807f-cd01013db359"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " containing your choice of either Prismatic Spray or 7th-rank "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "989ec875-261d-5d4f-a181-fedf889f9d4b"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You can have only one "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "glyph of warding",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " from a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ring of maniacal devices",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " active at a time, even if you have multiple rings, and the spell ends if you lose your investiture in the ring."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:thievery"],
        "type": "item",
        "value": 3,
        "predicate": [
          {
            "or": ["action:disable-a-device", "action:pick-a-lock"]
          }
        ],
        "display": {
          "label": "Ring of Maniacal Devices (Disable Devices and Pick a Lock)"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:crafting"],
